---
title: One player, retained memory and bounded semantic execution
---
flowchart TD
  accTitle: Player decisions, historical memory and one mission writer
  accDescr: The user sets objectives and can Pause independently. The lead freezes admission and source, reviews evidence and verifies acceptance. One designated player plans, interprets visible evidence and uses structured player tools. The adapter retains exact requests and collects results and images through the existing ingress; it is not another executor. Retained campaign memory supports decisions but grants no authority. One MissionRuntime writer checks original limits and exact controller and native fences before the real windowed game. Actual frames and operation receipts return to the player and observer. Actual host loading without routine review and a full independent mission with a fresh player remain acceptance gates; the lead supplies no ordinary gameplay rescue.
  User["You: objective and boundaries"] --> Lead["Lead: admission and engineering<br/>Review and final verification"]
  Lead -->|"One finite assignment"| Player["Designated player<br/>Plan, interpret, remember, verify"]
  Memory["Evidence-linked campaign memory<br/>Claims, corrections and unfinished Work<br/>Historical, never input authority"] --> Player
  Player -->|"Choose intent, source and limits"| Tools["Structured player tools<br/>Retain request, collect result and exact image<br/>Official MCP SDK; no executor"]
  Tools -->|"Existing authenticated ingress"| Runtime["One MissionRuntime writer<br/>Original root and child limits"]
  Runtime --> Controller["Controller and native fences<br/>Exact lease, source and deadlines"]
  Controller --> Game["Real windowed CDDA"]
  Game --> Evidence["Visible frames and receipts<br/>Actual effects and uncertainty"]
  Evidence --> Tools
  Tools -->|"Result, image and uncertainty"| Player
  Runtime --> Memory
  Evidence --> Viewer["Observer: objective and progress<br/>Historical context and unknown costs"]
  Runtime --> Viewer
  User -->|"Pause stops new dispatch"| Controller
  Runtime -.-> Gate["Pending acceptance<br/>Actual host with zero routine review<br/>Independent mission and fresh player"]
